correctness[threadid-buffer]: `counts` is indexed by thread ID
 --> positive.jl:6:9
  |
6 |         counts[threadid()] += x
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ task may switch thread between read and write
  |
  = why: tasks migrate between threads, so two tasks can share one slot and race
  = fix: keep state per task: chunk work and give each chunk its own buffer (OhMyThreads.jl)   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain threadid-buffer

correctness[threadid-buffer]: `scratch` is indexed by thread ID
  --> positive.jl:11:1
   |
11 | scratch[Threads.threadid()] = 0
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ task may switch thread between read and write
   |
   = why: tasks migrate between threads, so two tasks can share one slot and race
   = fix: keep state per task: chunk work and give each chunk its own buffer (OhMyThreads.jl)   [manual]
